        "value": "severely endangered",
        "source": "elcat-v2024.1",
        "note": "the younger generation has gone over (in the last 20 years) to using regular Mongolian (the Inner Mongolian standard, or the Khorchin dialect). [Endangerment.Certainty: 0.8]",
