        "note": "Khamnigan Mongol (8234) = Severely Endangered (80 percent certain, based on the evidence available) (the younger generation has gone over (in the last 20 years) to using regular Mongolian (the Inner Mongolian standard, or the Khorchin dialect).) [Janhunen 2015](cldf:janhunen:15:1)",
